:"Virtualization is fundamental to modern infrastructure."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Virtual machines"},{"text":"Hypervisors"},{"text":"VM networking"},{"text":"VM storage"},{"text":"Snapshots"},{"text":"Templates"},{"text":"Resource allocation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools/concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VMware"},{"text":"Hyper-V"},{"text":"VirtualBox"},{"text":"KVM"},{"text":"Proxmox"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Physical Server","Hypervisor","Virtual Machines"]},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"┌───┼───┐"},{"text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"text":"VM1 VM2 VM3"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Cloud Administration"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern System Administrator should develop cloud skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Start with one major cloud platform:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Microsoft Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compute"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Virtual networks"},{"text":"Firewalls/security groups"},{"text":"Load balancing"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Backup"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"DNS"},{"text":"Auto scaling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AWS example areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EC2"},{"text":"S3"},{"text":"VPC"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"CloudWatch"},{"text":"Route 53"},{"text":"RDS"},{"text":"Load Balancing"},{"text":"The equivalent concepts should also be understood across Azure/GCP rather than memorizing one provider's product names."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud Infrastructure Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["User","DNS","Load Balancer","Application Server","Database","Storage","Monitoring","Backup"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Security"},{"type":"p","text":"Security should be built into system administration from the beginning."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorization"},{"text":